# Build context of the API image (M8). An allow-list: everything is excluded, then only what
# the image needs is let back in. Market data, saved runs and studies, reports, .git, .env,
# virtual environments and caches can therefore never be copied into an image, even by
# accident. They reach the running container only as bind mounts (compose.yaml).
